{"name": "s2", "dur": 78.49, "lines": [{"id": "b01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.59, "clip": 0.27, "text": "五个 1 连在一起，", "ch": [0.35, 0.474, 0.598, 0.722, 0.846, 0.97, 1.094, 1.218, 1.342, 1.466], "sub": null, "big": "五个 1 连在一起，", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b02", "t0": 1.99, "t1": 2.74, "clip": 1.94, "text": "就是一条直线。", "ch": [1.99, 2.097, 2.204, 2.311, 2.419, 2.526, 2.633], "sub": null, "big": "就是一条直线。", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b03", "t0": 3.14, "t1": 5.53, "clip": 3.08, "text": "芯片要自己听出节拍，才数得清。", "ch": [3.14, 3.303, 3.466, 3.629, 3.792, 3.955, 4.118, 4.281, 4.444, 4.607, 4.88, 5.01, 5.14, 5.27, 5.4], "sub": "自己听出节拍，才数得清", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b04", "t0": 5.98, "t1": 10.08, "clip": 5.91, "text": "芯片之间的高速数据，是排成一列、一个接一个送过去的。", "ch": [5.98, 6.144, 6.308, 6.472, 6.636, 6.8, 6.964, 7.128, 7.292, 7.456, 7.72, 7.872, 8.023, 8.175, 8.327, 8.478, 8.77, 8.901, 9.032, 9.163, 9.294, 9.425, 9.556, 9.687, 9.818, 9.949], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b05", "t0": 10.33, "t1": 13.87, "clip": 10.24, "text": "发货端把并排的数据排成一列，以极快的节奏送上路。", "ch": [10.33, 10.479, 10.629, 10.778, 10.927, 11.076, 11.226, 11.375, 11.524, 11.674, 11.823, 11.972, 12.121, 12.271, 12.52, 12.655, 12.79, 12.925, 13.06, 13.195, 13.33, 13.465, 13.6, 13.735], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L21"}, {"id": "b06", "t0": 14.12, "t1": 16.94, "clip": 14.06, "text": "今天一条通道，每秒要送出上千亿个比特。", "ch": [14.12, 14.251, 14.383, 14.514, 14.646, 14.777, 14.909, 15.14, 15.29, 15.44, 15.59, 15.74, 15.89, 16.04, 16.19, 16.34, 16.49, 16.64, 16.79], "sub": "一条通道，每秒上千亿个比特", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L22"}, {"id": "b07", "t0": 17.39, "t1": 19.55, "clip": 17.34, "text": "把这一秒放大，再放大，再放大，", "ch": [17.39, 17.514, 17.639, 17.763, 17.887, 18.011, 18.136, 18.45, 18.577, 18.705, 18.832, 19.08, 19.197, 19.315, 19.432], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L23"}, {"id": "b08", "t0": 19.8, "t1": 23.65, "clip": 19.74, "text": "才看得见一个个比特：这一秒里，有上千亿个这样的比特。", "ch": [19.8, 19.926, 20.052, 20.178, 20.304, 20.43, 20.556, 20.682, 20.808, 20.934, 21.24, 21.37, 21.5, 21.63, 21.76, 22.09, 22.232, 22.374, 22.515, 22.657, 22.799, 22.941, 23.083, 23.225, 23.366, 23.508], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L24"}, {"id": "b09", "t0": 24.1, "t1": 27.59, "clip": 24.04, "text": "到了收货端，再把这一列重新拆开，并排放回芯片里。", "ch": [24.1, 24.477, 24.853, 25.23, 25.607, 25.983, 26.47, 26.505, 26.54, 26.575, 26.61, 26.645, 26.68, 26.715, 26.75, 26.785, 26.92, 27.004, 27.087, 27.171, 27.255, 27.339, 27.422, 27.506], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L25"}, {"id": "b10", "t0": 27.84, "t1": 32.91, "clip": 27.79, "text": "这里有个容易被忽略的难处：信号里的 0 和 1，并不是一件件分开的包裹。", "ch": [27.84, 27.994, 28.147, 28.301, 28.455, 28.608, 28.762, 28.915, 29.069, 29.223, 29.376, 29.53, 29.684, 29.837, 29.949, 30.061, 30.172, 30.284, 30.396, 30.508, 30.619, 30.731, 30.843, 30.955, 31.066, 31.22, 31.374, 31.527, 31.681, 31.835, 31.988, 32.142, 32.295, 32.449, 32.603, 32.756], "sub": "0 和 1 不是分开的包裹", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L26"}, {"id": "b11", "t0": 33.36, "t1": 37.65, "clip": 33.3, "text": "比如连续五个 1，到了收货端，就是一段连在一起、没有缝隙的高电平。", "ch": [33.36, 33.479, 33.598, 33.718, 33.837, 33.956, 34.075, 34.194, 34.313, 34.432, 34.567, 34.701, 34.835, 34.969, 35.103, 35.237, 35.371, 35.505, 35.639, 35.773, 35.907, 36.041, 36.175, 36.309, 36.443, 36.578, 36.712, 36.846, 36.98, 37.114, 37.248, 37.382, 37.516], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L27"}, {"id": "b12", "t0": 38.1, "t1": 42.22, "clip": 38.05, "text": "要数清这里有几个 1，就得知道每个比特占多长时间，这就是“节拍”。", "ch": [38.1, 38.217, 38.334, 38.451, 38.568, 38.685, 38.802, 38.919, 39.036, 39.153, 39.27, 39.388, 39.516, 39.645, 39.774, 39.903, 40.031, 40.16, 40.289, 40.418, 40.546, 40.675, 40.804, 40.933, 41.061, 41.19, 41.319, 41.447, 41.576, 41.705, 41.834, 41.962, 42.091], "sub": "每个比特占多长时间 = 节拍", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L28"}, {"id": "b13", "t0": 42.47, "t1": 44.15, "clip": 42.42, "text": "只看高低，是数不清的。", "ch": [42.47, 42.628, 42.786, 42.944, 43.102, 43.38, 43.508, 43.637, 43.765, 43.893, 44.022], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L29"}, {"id": "b14", "t0": 44.6, "t1": 52.01, "clip": 44.54, "text": "这类高速连接，通常不另外送一个节拍器过去，而是让收货端从信号高低变化的节奏里，自己推算出节拍，", "ch": [44.6, 44.737, 44.874, 45.011, 45.149, 45.286, 45.423, 45.69, 45.833, 45.976, 46.119, 46.261, 46.404, 46.547, 46.69, 46.833, 46.976, 47.119, 47.261, 47.404, 47.547, 47.87, 48.022, 48.173, 48.325, 48.477, 48.628, 48.78, 48.932, 49.083, 49.235, 49.387, 49.538, 49.69, 49.842, 49.993, 50.145, 50.297, 50.448, 50.87, 51.013, 51.155, 51.298, 51.44, 51.583, 51.725, 51.868], "sub": "不送节拍器，从跳变里推算节拍", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L30"}, {"id": "b15", "t0": 52.26, "t1": 57.23, "clip": 52.2, "text": "所以发出去之前，数据还会先被打乱一下，让高低变化够多，节拍才一直听得出来。", "ch": [52.26, 52.394, 52.529, 52.663, 52.797, 52.932, 53.066, 53.2, 53.335, 53.469, 53.603, 53.738, 53.872, 54.006, 54.141, 54.275, 54.409, 54.544, 54.678, 54.812, 54.946, 55.081, 55.215, 55.349, 55.484, 55.618, 55.752, 55.887, 56.021, 56.155, 56.29, 56.424, 56.558, 56.693, 56.827, 56.961, 57.096], "sub": "先打乱，让高低变化够多", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b16", "t0": 57.48, "t1": 59.26, "clip": 57.42, "text": "再按节拍，一个一个地清点。", "ch": [57.48, 57.626, 57.772, 57.918, 58.064, 58.32, 58.438, 58.555, 58.673, 58.79, 58.908, 59.025, 59.143], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L31"}, {"id": "b17", "t0": 59.51, "t1": 62.73, "clip": 59.39, "text": "业内把这一步叫时钟数据恢复，简称 CDR。", "ch": [59.51, 59.664, 59.817, 59.971, 60.124, 60.278, 60.431, 60.585, 60.739, 60.892, 61.046, 61.199, 61.353, 61.506, 61.79, 61.924, 62.059, 62.193, 62.327, 62.461, 62.596], "sub": "时钟数据恢复 CDR", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "b18", "t0": 62.98, "t1": 68.07, "clip": 62.93, "text": "这就是理解 SerDes 的基本框架：发出去时排成一列，收进来时听准节拍、拆回一排。", "ch": [62.98, 63.094, 63.208, 63.322, 63.435, 63.549, 63.663, 63.777, 63.891, 64.005, 64.119, 64.232, 64.346, 64.46, 64.574, 64.688, 64.802, 64.916, 65.029, 65.143, 65.271, 65.398, 65.525, 65.652, 65.78, 65.907, 66.034, 66.161, 66.288, 66.416, 66.543, 66.67, 66.797, 66.925, 67.052, 67.179, 67.306, 67.434, 67.561, 67.688, 67.816, 67.943], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L32"}, {"id": "b19", "t0": 68.52, "t1": 69.27, "clip": 68.46, "text": "一句话带走。", "ch": [68.52, 68.645, 68.77, 68.895, 69.02, 69.145], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L46"}, {"id": "b20", "t0": 69.52, "t1": 73.26, "clip": 69.46, "text": "SerDes 发出时排队，收到时先听准节拍，再拆回一排。", "ch": [69.52, 69.554, 69.588, 69.622, 69.655, 69.689, 69.723, 69.757, 69.791, 69.825, 69.858, 69.892, 69.926, 70.09, 70.178, 70.266, 70.353, 70.441, 70.529, 70.617, 70.704, 70.792, 71.03, 71.402, 71.773, 72.145, 72.517, 72.888], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L48"}, {"id": "b21", "t0": 73.51, "t1": 76.89, "clip": 73.45, "text": "下一条：一颗芯片号称跑得快，该问它哪三个问题？", "ch": [73.51, 73.608, 73.705, 73.803, 74.02, 74.176, 74.332, 74.488, 74.644, 74.8, 74.956, 75.112, 75.268, 75.424, 75.69, 75.823, 75.957, 76.09, 76.223, 76.357, 76.49, 76.623, 76.757], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "新增"}], "shots": [{"kind": "scope", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "b01", "t1": 5.68}, {"kind": "stream", "t0": 5.68, "paper": false, "first": "b04", "t1": 17.09}, {"kind": "zoom", "t0": 17.09, "paper": false, "first": "b07", "t1": 23.8}, {"kind": "unpack", "t0": 23.8, "paper": false, "first": "b09", "t1": 33.06}, {"kind": "desk", "t0": 33.06, "paper": true, "first": "b11", "strips": [{"id": "O5", "line": "b11", "from": "连续", "to": "1"}, {"id": "O6", "line": "b11", "from": "就是", "to": "一起"}, {"id": "O7", "line": "b11", "from": "没有", "to": "电平"}], "t1": 37.8}, {"kind": "level", "t0": 37.8, "paper": false, "first": "b12", "t1": 44.3}, {"kind": "cdr", "t0": 44.3, "paper": false, "first": "b14", "t1": 68.22}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 68.22, "paper": true, "first": "b19", "strips": [{"id": "E0", "line": "b19", "from": null, "to": null}, {"id": "E3", "line": "b20", "from": "SerDes", "to": "排队"}, {"id": "E4", "line": "b20", "from": "收到", "to": "听准"}, {"id": "E5", "line": "b20", "from": "节拍", "to": "一排"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 78.49}], "hudIn": 5.68}